  "releaseNotes": "DarkButton: render smooth, symmetric rounded corners and a uniform border ring for normal and Liquid Glass buttons. Add DarkIoStatusTable.AllowOutputControl to lock manual Output control (monitor-only mode) without dimming the switches - added DarkToggleSwitch.ReadOnly so a locked switch keeps its normal ON/OFF colors and only loses click-ability, separate from Enabled which still dims for offline (IsOnline=false) rows. DarkTextBox: add HintText (native cue-banner placeholder shown while empty), Multiline support (WordWrap/ScrollBars), and a new IPv4 InputMode that behaves like the classic segmented IP editor - typing 3 digits auto-advances past the dot, Space/'.' advances early, values are capped at 0-255 per octet. Previous release: fix DarkCheckedListBox (owner-drawn checkboxes/labels no longer sit under the border), DarkTabControl per-tab Font support, DarkTextBox virtual keyboard auto-close on click-away, DarkDateTimePicker dark dropdown calendar + ShowTime, corner/border fixes across several controls, and the DarkTextBox redesign (vertical centering, unit suffix, truncated numeric input, virtual keyboard).",
